00:05:50.441 --> 00:05:57.041
Starship Block 3 is the engineering reality behind a 124 meter stack, 9 meters in diameter,

00:05:57.041 --> 00:06:02.961
with a reusable low-earth orbit cargo target above 100 tons. Super heavy the

00:06:02.961 --> 00:06:09.381
first stage stretches 72 meters and carries 3,650 tons of propellant. 33

00:06:09.381 --> 00:06:15.641
Raptor 3 engines make 8,240 tons of thrust at sea level. That cluster is an

00:06:15.641 --> 00:06:20.241
engine out design. Lose one Raptor on the way up and the rest can still lift a

00:06:20.241 --> 00:06:25.541
wet mass of thousands of tons. Ship the upper stage measures 52 meters and

00:06:25.541 --> 00:06:31.441
holds 1,600 tons of propellant. It flies three raptors built for sea level and three

00:06:31.441 --> 00:06:39.301
built for vacuum, 1,614 tons of thrust in all. Each sea level raptor 3 near 250 tons.

00:06:39.881 --> 00:06:45.981
A closed cycle methalox system, methane and liquid oxygen, pushes fuel and oxidizer through

00:06:45.981 --> 00:06:52.261
the turbopumps first, then into the chamber. That is full flow staged combustion. No turbine

00:06:52.261 --> 00:06:56.301
an exhaust dumped overboard, so every kilogram does work in the chamber.

00:06:56.801 --> 00:07:01.981
The cycle raises chamber pressure and specific impulse, the push per kilogram of propellant,

00:07:02.321 --> 00:07:03.081
while cutting parts.

00:07:03.761 --> 00:07:08.421
Methane stays liquid at friendlier temperatures than hydrogen, which keeps tank volume down,

00:07:08.961 --> 00:07:12.721
and it does not leave the carbon-soot caracene leaves in a reused chamber.

00:07:13.341 --> 00:07:19.221
Flight 14 held orbit long enough to deploy 26 star-link V3 satellites, each designed for

00:07:19.221 --> 00:07:21.501
roughly one terabyte per second of downlink.

00:07:21.501 --> 00:07:27.701
something earlier blocks did not complete. Heat shield tiles in a hexagonal layout on the ship survived

00:07:27.701 --> 00:07:32.961
reentry and left the vehicle in shape to fly again. The booster's engine count supplied the

00:07:32.961 --> 00:07:38.181
thrust to weight for super heavy return and tower catch on prior flights, proving the propellant

00:07:38.181 --> 00:07:44.241
load and engine count delivered the Delta V margin, left over velocity, to come home rather than fall

00:07:44.241 --> 00:07:51.061
short. A common bulkhead, a single wall between oxygen and methane tanks on both stages, saved structural

00:07:51.061 --> 00:07:56.481
mass versus separate tanks. At this diameter, a second dome is on the order of several tons

00:07:56.481 --> 00:08:01.701
that become payload fraction instead of steel, and the rocket equation punishes extra dry

00:08:01.701 --> 00:08:07.261
mass all the way to orbit. That mass saving compounds with higher chamber pressure, so the

00:08:07.261 --> 00:08:11.741
same propellant load delivers more total impulse than an equivalent open cycle engine.

00:08:12.421 --> 00:08:18.481
Raptor 3 deleted external lines and valves makes about 35% more thrust than Raptor 1 with

00:08:18.481 --> 00:08:23.561
fewer parts, and shrinks the idiot index how many times the finished engine costs over

00:08:23.561 --> 00:08:28.861
its raw inputs. The gap is not the nickel or the methane, which are industrial commodities,

00:08:29.401 --> 00:08:33.801
but the machining, the tolerances, and the active cooling passages that keep a few hundred

00:08:33.801 --> 00:08:39.481
bar chamber from melting. Those tolerances are met with additive manufacturing, metal printing

00:08:39.481 --> 00:08:44.941
and precision machining SpaceX has scaled in its own facilities. Fewer external leak

00:08:44.941 --> 00:08:49.501
points is why post-flight inspection can be far lighter, and that is what lets a super

00:08:49.501 --> 00:08:55.101
heavy booster be caught, looked over, and re-flown, and a ship return closer to airline-style

00:08:55.101 --> 00:08:57.421
turnaround instead of expending the hardware.

00:08:58.061 --> 00:09:03.261
Magic wand accounting for this stack is stainless tank metal, plus on the order of 5,000 tons

00:09:03.261 --> 00:09:06.341
of industrial methane and oxygen across both stages.

00:09:07.021 --> 00:09:11.781
Reuse is how the flown vehicle stops paying a painful multiple of that wand number on

00:09:11.781 --> 00:09:12.561
every ascent.

